      "note": [
        "Escalations moving from old to new covenants:",
        "cerimonial washings -> baptism (complete submersion)",
        "John's baptism -> Jesus' baptism",
        "physical act (adultery, murder) -> heart (lust, anger)",
        "blood of animals -> blood of Jesus Christ",
        "copies of heavenly things (temple) -> Jesus entered heaven itself (Heb 9:24)",
        "sacrifices again and again -> Jesus offered Himself once for all (Heb 9:26)",
        "Jesus came not to abolish the law but to fulfill it"
      ]
    }
